    "description": "<p>VESPERYN</p>\n<p>The teeth inherited from your deathless ancestor have grown into proper weapons, and the taste of blood awakens instincts far older than you.<br>You gain the following natural attack:<br>Fangs Damage 1d6 P; FDC 5; Traits Agile, Finesse<br>Whenever your Fangs inflict a critical injury upon a living creature capable of bleeding, that creature also gains Bleed 1.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: Fangs (1d6 P, Agile, Finesse) arrive as a natural attack on your weapons, and a critical injury they inflict on a living creature lays Bleed 1.</p>",
